OL,3,GNEWSA'Give us a reason to stay', young
OL,4,Avoters say
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty years after the Isle of Man
OL,7,Fintroduced votes for 16-year-olds,
OL,8,Fyoung people say housing, healthcare
OL,9,Fand opportunities are among the issues
OL,10,Fthat will shape how they vote in
OL,11,FThursday's general election.
OL,13,FSixteen students shared their views
OL,14,Fwith BBC Isle of Man ahead of polling
OL,15,Fday, with one saying politicians needed
OL,16,Fto "give us a reason to stay" and
OL,17,Fanother arguing the island could feel
OL,18,F"more like a retirement plan" than
OL,19,Fsomewhere to build a life.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
